"--------
"Options
"--------
set showmode
set number
set autoindent
set ignorecase
set tabstop=4
set shiftwidth=4
set wrapmargin=0
set shell=/bin/bash

"-----
Mappings
"-----
"map ^[[5~ ^B
"map ^[[6~ ^F

"-------
"Weird stuff
"-------
"Colorscheme does not work
"Obviously. But it can give an idea for a 
"change colour command for the terminal
colorscheme lunaperche
